WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.980
<b><i>We look the same, but men call us monsters. 

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:21.790
H-Have my eyes gone mad?

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:23.000
Is that really...

00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:03.350
Don't make me repeat myself, Hachirou.

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:08.440
<b><i>The Cherry Blossoms Run Mad</i></b>

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:06.360
I can't let you go.

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:08.640
We still don't know what we're up against.

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:11.060
And that's why I need to go.

00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:15.100
No, you don't. The Five Flowers 
will soon be here.

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:16.070
Until they arrive...

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:18.170
Do you think they're even alive?

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:21.450
Isn't the enemy here because 
they were defeated?

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:27.830
If this foe defeated the Five Treasures, 
then as leader, it is my duty to go.

00:02:28.170 --> 00:02:29.210
Enough!

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:35.920
We aren't just trying to protect 
you because of your position.

00:02:36.610 --> 00:02:39.030
We need to protect the techniques,

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:42.230
the power, that you and Hibiki inherited!

00:02:44.870 --> 00:02:46.590
That's what's going on here.

00:03:01.930 --> 00:03:02.900
Over there.

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:03.490
Right.

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:09.750
What is that monster?!

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:10.870
Don't ask me.

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:13.130
How do we fight something like that?

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:15.190
Don't be a coward.

00:03:15.190 --> 00:03:16.750
That's only an illusion.

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:19.090
Just like your technique?

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:20.900
Don't compare them!

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:23.430
Just close your eyes, and it will disappear.

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:26.320
I don't know about that...

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:28.930
The mind of the beholder

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:33.520
is what determines if something 
is real or an illusion.

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:39.800
Some cannot survive the real world 
without clinging to an illusion.

00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:46.030
Real or illusion, it makes little difference.

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:50.530
You still look unhappy about this.

00:03:50.530 --> 00:03:52.740
The only thing that matters is my blood.

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:56.420
Is that what has you out of sorts?

00:03:56.830 --> 00:03:59.230
No. It's just...

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:01.800
Remember what you said?

00:04:02.640 --> 00:04:04.950
If the world remains at peace,

00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:08.310
there may be no need for ninjas.

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:11.530
Then that blood...

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:16.560
That is why, at times, people need 
something to cling to,

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:21.650
even if it is only an illusion.

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:24.320
Understand that.

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:28.760
If you understand, and still want 
to do things your own way,

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:31.700
I won't say another word.

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:39.970
Up ahead is a shaft leading downward.

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:42.150
Enter it. It's a shortcut to the mountain.

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:42.970
Got it.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:46.380
Don't come back until things calm down.

00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:50.080
When will that happen?

00:04:51.890 --> 00:04:52.730
Got it?

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:00.560
Saizou!

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:02.550
They already know where we are.

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:05.740
Hey! Are you the one that's 
controlling that monster?

00:05:07.980 --> 00:05:09.390
Monster?

00:05:09.390 --> 00:05:11.870
How stupid.

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:15.400
Its form, like the gods of India,

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:17.880
only reminds you of a monster?

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:19.400
Shut up.

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:22.070
So, are Hachirou of Kouga

00:05:22.070 --> 00:05:25.630
and Hibiki of Iga among you?

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:27.840
It doesn't matter.

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:32.640
If they are, they'll use their 
eye magic to fight back.

00:05:32.920 --> 00:05:37.140
If none of you can do that, you can die.

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:48.040
God or monster, if we can 
just defeat that old guy...

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:50.410
Yeah. It'll disappear, for sure.

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:57.150
Shikibu, we'll draw it 
behind the hill. Got it?

00:06:02.240 --> 00:06:03.670
<i>Where did he go?</i>

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:32.910
I see...

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:34.730
That's my...

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:40.180
You show your foes impossible 
things to confuse them.

00:06:40.690 --> 00:06:43.420
That is your technique?

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:48.300
But unfortunately, it doesn't 
work on those who don't see it.

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:51.430
Shut up! You saw it!

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:54.260
I did not.

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:57.930
It simply showed itself on 
the film in my eyeballs.

00:06:58.230 --> 00:06:58.930
What?

00:06:59.510 --> 00:07:02.550
If you don't see it again in your mind,

00:07:03.090 --> 00:07:05.440
you don't really "see" it.

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.620
Wh-What is he saying?

00:07:07.620 --> 00:07:11.580
He's saying his eyes are 
only tools for seeing things?

00:07:11.580 --> 00:07:12.570
You, too?!

00:07:12.860 --> 00:07:15.950
Your technique cannot kill anyone.

00:07:16.230 --> 00:07:18.450
Give back my scarf!

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:27.760
Tell me if what's about to 
happen is real or an illusion.

00:07:57.790 --> 00:08:00.120
That monster isn't an illusion?

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:00.870
Don't ask me!

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.870
Your bullet struck it.

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:05.210
Yeah.

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:22.800
I guess it won't follow us farther.

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:26.030
Yeah, but that's all the brains it has.

00:08:26.030 --> 00:08:27.660
Shikibu, run!

00:08:57.980 --> 00:08:59.000
We got it...

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:00.560
Yeah.

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:06.350
I guess even the Buddha himself 
wouldn't have seen that trap coming.

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:08.500
But it was reckless.

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:11.010
You caught Hachisu in it, too.

00:09:11.010 --> 00:09:13.230
You saved him, right?

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:17.510
I told you, right?

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:20.330
I made an illusion real.

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:24.830
Your techniques are mere child's play.

00:09:25.550 --> 00:09:27.020
Ow...

00:09:27.020 --> 00:09:29.390
I must have broken something.

00:09:30.150 --> 00:09:31.380
Shut up.

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:33.140
Stop talking for once.

00:09:33.140 --> 00:09:35.260
I broke a leg and an arm.

00:09:36.560 --> 00:09:40.600
Why... is seeing an illusion 
enough to make us...

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:45.980
It seems...

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:52.350
<i>It seems my heart... wants me 
to die of this longing.</i>

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:54.360
All the jet-black night...

00:09:56.220 --> 00:09:58.360
He comes to me in dreams,

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:01.190
to keep my hopeless passion burning.

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:04.240
<i>My Ninja Technique...</i>

00:10:05.030 --> 00:10:06.870
<i>Dreaming Reality!</i>

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:18.720
Oh, my.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:24.310
So you knew how to make 
illusions reality, as well?

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:32.560
What was that?

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:34.400
Tch...

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:35.660
He got away, huh?

00:10:47.970 --> 00:10:49.420
We're falling back, Shikibu!

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:50.080
Right.

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:30.780
What a... What a lovely sight!

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:34.630
Children pushing themselves 
to their limits...

00:11:34.840 --> 00:11:37.710
You can't help but cry.

00:11:47.330 --> 00:11:49.860
Hey, are we really not going back?

00:11:50.790 --> 00:11:53.270
Are we really leaving everyone?

00:11:53.700 --> 00:11:55.910
We just decided this.

00:11:57.090 --> 00:11:58.530
I'll go up first.

00:11:59.190 --> 00:12:02.780
If that's what everyone really wants.

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:17.920
Watch out! Get back, Hibiki!

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:24.050
Hachirou, what are you doing?

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:27.030
If I didn't do this, you'd follow me.

00:12:27.520 --> 00:12:30.930
I understand how everyone feels, 
and I'm doing this, anyway.

00:12:32.010 --> 00:12:33.810
I'll catch up fast.

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:38.320
I just need to buy time. 
I can end it before you do.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.010
You dummy!

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:56.210
Wh-What is this?

00:13:21.480 --> 00:13:24.740
Is this filthy technique yours?

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:27.270
How childish...

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:31.990
What is her technique, then?

00:13:43.110 --> 00:13:44.760
Oh, my!

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:50.010
<i>Ninja Technique: Butterfly.</i>

00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:10.710
Your tears are curious.

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:15.410
They have the power to stir the lusts of men?

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:24.100
But girl, you lack the body 
required to seduce anyone.

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:26.150
You disgusting old man!

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:30.950
It seems you've run out of techniques.

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:33.180
Now, die.

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:48.070
That's...

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:54.700
Kouga Hachirou.

00:15:08.320 --> 00:15:12.110
Enough, Neirichiou. Leave.

00:15:22.360 --> 00:15:25.730
Hachirou... I'm sorry.

00:15:26.510 --> 00:15:30.130
You heard that voice. Get out of here.

00:15:31.490 --> 00:15:35.740
And find Utsutsu and Saizou. 
Then tell Gorone and Namenba.

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:38.060
Okay.

00:15:38.060 --> 00:15:41.530
We'll do what you say.

00:15:42.520 --> 00:15:43.650
Pathetic.

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:52.310
I see.

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:54.510
Then it's you?

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:57.770
You are... Joujin.

00:15:58.000 --> 00:16:03.520
I have beheld the power you gained 
from Kouga Gennosuke.

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:08.150
Why did you kill the Five Flowers 
and the Five Treasures?

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:10.850
A good question...

00:16:10.850 --> 00:16:13.910
To show our power.

00:16:14.190 --> 00:16:15.070
What?

00:16:15.660 --> 00:16:20.540
And the last step is to take your heads.

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:23.220
Taking such young lives is a shame.

00:16:23.570 --> 00:16:26.590
But when you were born a leader,

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:30.670
that became your destiny.

00:16:42.530 --> 00:16:45.720
Why isn't your technique working?

00:16:46.180 --> 00:16:48.320
That's what your face seems to say.

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:54.580
No normal man, or even a thunder god,

00:16:54.580 --> 00:17:00.200
could kill without the desire 
to slaughter or harm.

00:17:01.050 --> 00:17:03.960
However, perhaps due to 
my spiritual training,

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:12.320
I can hurt people while my heart remains 
as calm as a still sea.

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:17.260
Your technique won't work on me.

00:17:26.570 --> 00:17:27.790
Ridiculous.

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:32.480
Your swordplay is nothing 
without your eye magic.

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:37.740
Now, die,

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:42.490
reflecting on the fact that 
your eye magic failed you.

00:17:57.360 --> 00:17:59.620
So you both are here, now.

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:12.280
I leave this in your hands, Yasha Itaru.

00:18:12.720 --> 00:18:16.660
Send those two to the underworld at once.

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:18.220
It's the least we can do.

00:18:18.220 --> 00:18:19.280
As you wish.

00:18:28.530 --> 00:18:31.420
Behold my mirror.

00:18:34.670 --> 00:18:38.750
This mirror shows your destiny.

00:18:39.810 --> 00:18:43.740
Such old memories, such happy memories.

00:18:44.650 --> 00:18:48.950
Can you see the happiness you 
had when you were younger?

00:19:02.130 --> 00:19:04.200
But no one possesses

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:08.450
a destiny full of
naught but happiness.

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:12.970
At the end of all you've endured comes

00:19:12.970 --> 00:19:16.710
separation, sorrow, and pain.

00:19:17.400 --> 00:19:22.470
Eventually, life becomes little 
but a series of tragedies.

00:19:25.670 --> 00:19:26.600
No...

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:31.480
What are you seeing in my mirror?

00:19:37.010 --> 00:19:38.040
This is...

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:50.240
Run!

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:24.680
Namenba!

00:20:45.340 --> 00:20:46.830
Joujin-sama,

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:51.270
it seems you've taken a liking to them.

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:55.240
It will take several years.

00:20:55.240 --> 00:20:58.520
Wait and look forward to that moment.

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:17.310
Thank you, Gorone.

00:21:17.320 --> 00:21:18.960
You saved me.

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:21.840
Are you hurt?

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:26.090
You owe me for this one, Namenba.

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:40.290
Tadanaga-sama!

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:41.840
The lord is here!

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:43.880
I'm so glad you're safe.

00:21:44.900 --> 00:21:49.670
<i>It was only six months after this</i>

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:54.330
<i>that the former shogun's wife, 
Oeyo, passed away.</i>

00:23:25.050 --> 00:23:27.050
<b><i>Preview</i></b>

00:23:25.880 --> 00:23:27.050
Time passes,

00:23:27.450 --> 00:23:30.800
and those who lurk in shadow continue 
training their techniques.

00:23:31.430 --> 00:23:35.220
How should one rid oneself of earthly desire?

00:23:35.220 --> 00:23:38.270
Perhaps it is best done now,

00:23:35.560 --> 00:23:38.560
<b><i>Evil Clouds Begin to Stir</i></b>

00:23:38.270 --> 00:23:39.610
right here.
